                        // So we need to, for each delim in range, produce replacement: if compress mode, delim is single pattern, so one replace; if greedy/normal with run, we need to produce replace repeated cnt times? For normal, cnt=1, so single replace.
                        // For greedy, cnt is run count, so replace repeated cnt times.

